#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""Bastille App Store — browse, install, open, update and remove Flatpak apps.

Everything goes through /usr/local/bin/flatpak (Bastille's gatekeeper), which only lets curated apps be installed,
so the catalogue below is the full list of what can be installed. Installs are per-user (no root needed).
"""

